title Diet Manager

component diet-webapp as "Diet Manager Web App" web-application
component diet-api as "Diet Manager API" service
component diet-db as "Diet Manager Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south ubereats as "Uber Eats" service
south whatsapp as "WhatsApp" service
south nutrition-service as "Nutrition Database" service

north -> diet-webapp

diet-webapp -> diet-api
diet-webapp -> user-auth

diet-api -> diet-db
diet-api -> user-auth
diet-api -> ubereats
diet-api -> whatsapp
diet-api -> nutrition-service
